et scattered away by tiny particles.\\\\\\\" That's reasonable — scattering by air molecules/particles. Line 4: red and orange reach eyes. Good.\\\\n\\\\nLine 5 (T): \\\\\\\"That leaves warm colors to paint the evening sky.\\\\\\\" First letter T ✓.\\\\n\\\\nLine 6 (E): \\\\\\\"Every sunset thus ends in glorious red light.\\\\\\\" First letter E ✓, last word \\\\\\\"light\\\\\\\" ✓.\\\\n\\\\nFull text:\\\\n\\\\nSunsets glow red because of a trick of the atmosphere.\\\\nThe sun sits low, so its rays travel a long path through air.\\\\nWaves of blue light get scattered away by tiny particles.\\\\nDeep red and orange tones reach your eyes alone.\\\\nThat leaves warm colors to paint the evening sky.\\\\nEvery sunset thus ends in glorious red light.\\\\n\\\\nVerify constraints again:\\\\n\\\\n1. Exactly 6 lines ✓ (6 non-empty lines).\\\\n2. First letters: S, T, W, D, T, E → STWDTE ✓.\\\\n3. Line 4: \\\\\\\"Deep red and orange tones reach your eyes alone.\\\\\\\" — no \\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\"\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794483527,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":195,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1195,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000,\\\"prompt_tokens_details\\\":{\\\"cached_tokens\\\":0},\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":1000,\\\"completion_tokens_details\\\":{\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":1000}}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:1da960afd5578f6570dab843f9e0ed2c6128e71779124517469149cf6eaad84d:06437fa67eb12ae24b1877871b26d9c3ef86f6a4e153b32427d9bdc8101e95da\",\"signature\":\"0x26fa7e59981d2277fd5446b722600ce65cabc98abba64f93a28f4da24e85aeea48ae2c7c42c4109f39cc0d372272eef8518e9f9c2c44de836fa5781a12763ecf1c\",\"signing_address\":\"0x3b753b4406613c5e70ae640508632b600424fa0c\",\"signing_algo\":\"ecdsa\",\"signature_kind\":\"provider_tee\"},\"verdict\":{\"ok\":false,\"reason\":\"no <answer> block\"}},{\"task\":0,\"model\":\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",\"response\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"89f42db0c1684b1