\\\n        *   If Q=3, O=5, M=6 (O and M adjacent). Invalid.\\\\n        *   If Q=4, O=5, M=6 (O and M adjacent). Invalid.\\\\n        *   If Q=3, O=4, M=5 (O and M adjacent). Invalid.\\\\n    *   So, one valid arrangement in this case is: **Tess, Fern, Quin, Olga, Omar, Milo, Dina**.\\\\n\\\\n**Case B: Tess is at Seat 7.**\\\\n*   If T is at 7, then D must be at 1.\\\\n*   \\\\\\\"Tess sat next to Fern.\\\\\\\" Since T is at 7, F must be at 6.\\\\n*   Current arrangement: [D, _, _, _, _, F, T]\\\\n*   \\\\\\\"Fern sat somewhere to the left of Omar.\\\\\\\" F is at 6. For F < Om, Om must be to the right of 6. The only seat to the right of 6 is 7, but T is at 7. Thus, there is no seat for Omar to the right of Fern.\\\\n*   Therefore, Case B is impossible.\\\\n\\\\n**Conclusion:**\\\\nThe only valid configuration derived is from Case A.\\\\nSeat 1: Tess\\\\nSeat 2: Fern\\\\nSeat 3: Quin\\\\nSeat 4: Olga\\\\nSeat 5: Omar\\\\nSeat 6: Milo\\\\nSeat 7: Dina\\\\n\\\\nLet's double-check all conditions\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794483528,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":209,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1209,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000,\\\"prompt_tokens_details\\\":null,\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":0,\\\"completion_tokens_details\\\":{\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":0}}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8:56a6affa35934cad4699f1f25b2cb19a3340e4acc2cb31d029a7304c819e9188:5ed0b4e863a99a940d33a6ed0fec1a66cdd91e0ddfed10069a0586f7cbb2acbc\",\"signature\":\"0x54558961fe3c8c9e3555e75ee7a344575dc2f06163ce10b810c0d0c6aed443f37bbfc88ed1cbb0cdcb64977361e44dddc0d65a4fc4416c8104faea9f26bec42e1b\",\"signing_address\":\"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf\",\"signing_algo\":\"ecdsa\",\"signature_kind\":\"provider_tee\"},\"verdict\":{\"ok\":false,\"reason\":\"no <answer> block\"}},{\"task\":3,\"model\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash\",\"response\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"42efcf08fdc94c238f834